      "content": "\"letting go of the pressure\" .. i don't know. it feels like the pressure is literally part of who i am now. i look at my life and all i see is debt and expectations i can't meet and people i've let down. it's like i'm just stuck in this trap. there's no \"taking a break\" from this, it's just more of the same tomorrow. how am i even supposed to keep going when everything just feels so empty?",
